===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[paratyphoid]] [[fever]]|-}}

# {{context|pathology}} Any of a variety of acute infectious intestinal diseases resembling [[typhoid fever]] but less severe, caused by eating food contaminated with certain [[bacteria]] of the genus ''[[Salmonella]]''.

